            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fresh feathers! Parrot 0.29.1</h3><ul><li>The meeting window fits your screen again, and Detect speakers says who it heard.</li><li>Share a call's report with your team as a clean PDF, from the Share menu.</li><li>Each call names itself and says what it was about, right at the top.</li><li>An Assistant switch on the call screen, for when you only need the recording.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.1">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
